+// b2400 PKH bit 2 HYBRID (caller read the flag; RC C1217c): true while my HP + shield - reserve covers the damage group gi lands over the
+// rest of an in-reach clear by me alone (estimate() at its current HP, in its camp-budget units); reserve = the CAL share in the budget
+// plus PKH_HY_TAB[1] % of max HP per 100 bag gems (at most PKH_HY_TAB[2] %).
+bool pkh_inreach_ok(int gi)
+{
